  "description": "Jump into a party game for up to 4 players, featuring characters from\nThe Legend of Dark Witch Episode 4!\n\nPlay locally or online and compete in 6 fast-paced mini-games,\nwhere magic isn’t just for winning — it’s for messing with your mates.\n\n– Magic Changes Everything\nEach character can use unique magic to interrupt, trap,\nor turn the tide at the worst possible moment.\n\nWinning isn’t just about skill —\nit’s all about timing your magic and causing chaos.\n\n– Familiar Faces, New Battles\nFan-favourite characters return in a brand-new party game format.\nEasy to pick up, tricky to master — and always unpredictable.\n\n– 6 Different Mini-Games\nEvery game has its own rules, pace, and strategy.\nShort rounds, quick rematches, and nonstop laughs.",
